{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103778","id":2379592512,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6N1bNA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103778","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103778.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103778.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103778","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103778/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103778/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103778/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/860f1da3b8a13a2ed074227b41ec211f2b875f1f","number":103778,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix build errors when building with `disable_xr=yes`","user":{"login":"darksylinc","id":3395130,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTUxMzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3395130?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc","html_url":"https://github.com/darksylinc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Building with the following params (note: scu_build is enabled):\r\n\r\n```\r\nplatform=linuxbsd builtin_embree=yes builtin_enet=no\r\nbuiltin_freetype=yes builtin_graphite=yes builtin_harfbuzz=yes\r\nbuiltin_libogg=no builtin_libpng=yes builtin_libtheora=no\r\nbuiltin_libvorbis=no builtin_libwebp=no builtin_miniupnpc=no\r\nbuiltin_pcre2=no builtin_zlib=yes builtin_zstd=no linker=mold\r\noptimize=none debug_symbols=True tests=True dev_mode=True dev_build=True\r\nuse_llvm=yes use_lld=yes opengl3=no openxr=no disable_xr=yes -j 24\r\nscu_build=yes scu_limit=256\r\n```\r\n\r\nResults in compiler errors:\r\n\r\n```\r\nIn file included from servers/register_server_types.cpp:99:\r\nservers/xr/xr_interface.h:52:7: error: redefinition of 'RefCounted'\r\n   52 | class XRInterface : public RefCounted {\r\n      |       ^\r\n./servers/rendering/rendering_method.h:40:21: note: expanded from macro\r\n'XRInterface'\r\n   40 | #define XRInterface RefCounted\r\n      |                     ^\r\n./core/object/ref_counted.h:37:7: note: previous definition is here\r\n   37 | class RefCounted : public Object {\r\n      |       ^\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis happens because of:\r\n\r\n```\r\n#ifdef XR_DISABLED\r\n// RendererSceneCull::render_camera is empty when 3D is disabled, but\r\n// it and RenderingMethod::render_camera have a parameter for\r\nXRInterface.\r\n#define XRInterface RefCounted\r\n#else\r\n#include \"servers/xr/xr_interface.h\"\r\n#endif // XR_DISABLED\r\n```\r\n\r\nIn rendering_method.h\r\n\r\n\r\nThe problem was introduced in #103267","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":865585000,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4NjU1ODUwMDA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:xr","name":"topic:xr","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6